{
  "Guides the user through a multi-step task. It combines a [Stepper](/stepper) above or next to one page per step with Back and Next buttons below. Next validates the page first, and on the last step it finishes the wizard.": "",
  "Defining pages in JSX": "",
  "Each `WizardStep` is a step and its page. Next validates the kit fields on the page and then runs the step's own `validate`. If validation fails, the wizard stays on the page, marks the step and focuses the first invalid field. On the last step, Next becomes Finish and raises `onFinished`.": "",
  "`steps` creates steps from props, and each page is created from a `content` factory when first shown. `add`, `insert` and `remove` change the steps later, and `next()`, `previous()`, `goTo()` and `finish()` navigate.": "",
  "Custom buttons and asynchronous finish": "",
  "`showNavigation={false}` removes the bar, so your own buttons can call the methods. `onFinishing` can set a `promise`, and the wizard finishes when it resolves to `true` and stays open otherwise.": "",
  "A `nav` of steps, as on the [Stepper](/stepper) page. Each step is a button with its position and status in its name, and there is one Tab stop.": "",
  "A `group` named after its step. Hidden pages are removed from the accessibility tree.": "",
  "When validation fails, focus stays on the first invalid field with its message, and the step is announced as “Needs attention”.": "",
  "Kit buttons named “Back”, “Next” and “Finish” in the kit language.": "",
  "The wizard. `data-orientation`.": "Wizard. `data-orientation`.",
  "The stepper (also `.mx-stepper`).": "",
  "The pages and each page. A hidden page has `hidden`.": "",
  "The bar and its buttons.": "Çubuk ve düğmeleri.",
  "Units: the root, a page and the bar (a divider above it and its padding).": "",
  "Places: the appearance of the buttons in the bar (`variant`).": "",
  "The spacing between the stepper, pages and bar, and between the buttons, plus the stepper width when it is next to the pages.": "",
  "Wizard props": "Wizard prop'ları",
  "Steps created programmatically, each as `WizardStep` props. JSX `WizardStep` children come first.": "",
  "The current step, identified by its `key` or index. `x-model` provides two-way binding.": "",
  "A step can be reached only after the previous ones, and optional steps can be skipped.": "",
  "`horizontal` places the stepper above the pages, and `vertical` places it next to them.": "",
  "The position of the stepper text, in the horizontal orientation only.": "",
  "The size of the stepper.": "",
  "Shows the stepper, and the bar with the Back and Next buttons.": "",
  "Lets the user press the stepper steps.": "",
  "Creates a page when first shown and then keeps it. A step's own `lazy` takes precedence.": "",
  "With `false`, content created by a step's `content` is disposed while hidden and recreated when shown. A step's own `keepAlive` takes precedence.": "",
  "The kit strings “Back”, “Next” and “Finish”": "",
  "The accessible name of the stepper.": "",
  "WizardStep props": "WizardStep prop'ları",
  "The step text in the stepper. This is the same property as `text`.": "",
  "A second line below the title.": "",
  "The index": "",
  "Identifies the step in `value`. The JSX `key` also works.": "",
  "Displayed in the indicator instead of the number.": "",
  "Marks the step as optional, which appears below the title.": "",
  "`false` prevents the step from being reached.": "",
  "Shows the step with an error. The wizard sets it when the page fails validation and clears it when the page passes.": "",
  "The kit fields on the page are validated before the wizard moves on, and the first invalid field receives focus.": "",
  "Runs after the fields are validated. `false` keeps the page and marks the step.": "",
  "From the wizard": "",
  "See the wizard prop.": "",
  "Creates the page programmatically when the page is created.": "",
  "The stepper events. `onStepChanging` (`cancel`, `promise`) runs before the page is validated.": "",
  "Occurs when the last page is valid and the wizard is about to finish. `cancel = true` keeps it open, and `promise` waits and finishes on `true`.": "",
  "Occurs when the wizard finishes. Every step is shown as complete.": "",
  "Next validates the page and finishes on the last step. Back does not validate. `goTo` validates when moving forward.": "",
  "Validates the page, raises `onFinishing`, and then finishes.": "",
  "Validates the current page as Next does, without moving.": "",
  "Manage steps programmatically. A step from another wizard moves here.": "",
  "The `Stepper`, the `WizardStep` objects in order, the current step and its index.": "",
  "Indicate whether the current step is the last reachable one (Next finishes), and whether the wizard has finished.": "",
